(7534889, 1205218, 20608, '<td valign="top">I definitely feel pity yet almost elated that nature has come to reclaim the badness and surround the innocent building with life.<br/> <br/>Gret image, tiny nit-pick would be a touch of whitening in the sky, it looks a tad flat, put the highlights slider up a smidge.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'I definitely feel pity yet almost elated that nature has come to reclaim the badness and surround the innocent building with life. Gret image, tiny nit-pick would be a touch of whitening in the sky, it looks a tad flat, put the highlights slider up a smidge. 7', '2017-09-13 07:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534890, 1205262, 20608, '<td valign="top">What a crazy shot, exactly where I am right now with shadows/highlights. Excellent in B&amp;W (I know it was an obvious choice).<br/>The swirl carries me through this wonderland of contrast and shapes, the closed eyelashes, the twin trees (by the way my nit-pick is here... please get rid of that thing left side of the tree, pretty please).. regardless of that obstacle spoiling my journey through the total whiteness this is worthy of my top pick. 10</td>', 'What a crazy shot, exactly where I am right now with shadows/highlights. Excellent in B&W (I know it was an obvious choice).The swirl carries me through this wonderland of contrast and shapes, the closed eyelashes, the twin trees (by the way my nit-pick is here... please get rid of that thing left side of the tree, pretty please).. regardless of that obstacle spoiling my journey through the total whiteness this is worthy of my top pick. 10', '2017-09-13 07:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534892, 1205277, 20608, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh the honeycomb again. I like it, very pleased to see you using the shadows to effect. Did you use vignette? Get rid of the right side, portrait mode, this will create more feeling, my personal preference for this image. 6</td>', 'Ahhhh the honeycomb again. I like it, very pleased to see you using the shadows to effect. Did you use vignette? Get rid of the right side, portrait mode, this will create more feeling, my personal preference for this image. 6', '2017-09-13 07:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
